Atoms sort by tier: descendant (0), plain own (1), other own (2). The input
lists them in the opposite order.

  $ cat > a.ml <<EOT
  > [@@@css.atoms [
  >   ("_c0aother", ["._c0aother:hover{color:red}"], 2, 1, 1, []);
  >   ("_a0aplain", ["._a0aplain{color:red}"], 1, 0, 1, []);
  >   ("_c0adown", ["._c0adown>*{color:red}"], 0, 0, 1, [])
  > ]]
  > EOT

  $ styled-ppx.generate a.ml
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  ._c0adown>*{color:red}
  ._a0aplain{color:red}
  ._c0aother:hover{color:red}
